WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.041 --> 00:00:05.291
All right, we'll give you a choice.

00:00:05.583 --> 00:00:06.583
You can either have...

00:00:07.708 --> 00:00:09.083
Mario Hezonja

00:00:09.750 --> 00:00:10.500
Or...

00:00:11.458 --> 00:00:12.458
this horse.

00:00:14.125 --> 00:00:15.125
We'll take the horse

00:00:16.333 --> 00:00:18.500
When people ask you what happened here,

00:00:18.791 --> 00:00:21.041
tell them King James still rules the East.

00:00:22.125 --> 00:00:25.083
Also...tell them I'm better than Michael Jordan

00:01:07.833 --> 00:01:09.250
Someone's coming.

00:01:09.250 --> 00:01:11.958
Wait, what? A free agent? Coming to House Hornets?

00:01:11.958 --> 00:01:13.166
We have to blow the Charlotte horn!

00:01:13.291 --> 00:01:15.166
We have to blow the Charlotte horn!

00:01:15.166 --> 00:01:15.875
Wait…

00:01:15.875 --> 00:01:18.125
Uh...what was it? One blast for a knight returning...

00:01:18.125 --> 00:01:19.041
...there’s no rider.

00:01:19.041 --> 00:01:20.041
...Two for a buyout.

00:01:20.041 --> 00:01:22.541
Three for a eunuch trying to use a lady’s chamber pot. 

00:01:22.541 --> 00:01:23.500
It’s just a horse.

00:01:31.500 --> 00:01:33.916
How did you get in here?

00:01:35.500 --> 00:01:38.041
Is there any defense in this Realm anymore?

00:01:42.458 --> 00:01:44.791
He said what?!

00:01:44.791 --> 00:01:49.208
It's Meat Pie...Mondaaay!

00:01:50.875 --> 00:01:53.500
Wah! Meat Pie Mondaaay!

00:01:53.500 --> 00:01:54.166
Hey guys?

00:01:54.166 --> 00:01:54.791
Wait, LeBron...

00:01:54.791 --> 00:01:55.708
What’s up?

00:01:55.708 --> 00:01:56.291
Your hair. Fix your hair.

00:01:56.291 --> 00:01:57.083
Oh! Thank you.

00:01:57.916 --> 00:02:00.625
Uhm...hey, guys, guys...hey, guys.

00:02:00.625 --> 00:02:03.083
Hey everyone, so glad you all could be here.

00:02:03.083 --> 00:02:07.041
I just figured since so many of you summer in Los Angeles anyway,

00:02:07.041 --> 00:02:10.583
it would be fun to invite everyone over to my new Brentwood castle

00:02:10.583 --> 00:02:13.916
for some mingling, some pampering...a little tampering.

00:02:13.916 --> 00:02:17.708
But, before we dig into our delicious fast-fired artisanal

00:02:17.708 --> 00:02:21.041
Blaze Meat Pies, I do have some big news...

00:02:22.541 --> 00:02:24.250
...Ben Simmons hit a three-pointer.

00:02:25.375 --> 00:02:26.750
Very funny.

00:02:26.750 --> 00:02:28.916
I kid, I kid...oh, speaking of which...

00:02:28.916 --> 00:02:31.208
my serv–I mean my Lord Commanders

00:02:31.208 --> 00:02:33.666
have informed me that the pies are ready

00:02:33.666 --> 00:02:37.833
so everybody say it with me...it’s time for...

00:02:37.833 --> 00:02:41.958
Meat Pie Mondaaay!

00:02:41.958 --> 00:02:42.958
Trademark pending.

00:02:42.958 --> 00:02:45.500
Does he think he invented Meat Pie Mondays? 

00:02:45.500 --> 00:02:48.958
He should call it Maize Meat Pies because he is so corn—Oh! AD!

00:02:48.958 --> 00:02:52.666
Oh Kyrie, I must ask you…what are those?

00:02:52.666 --> 00:02:55.333
Oh yes. These are the new Kyrie Five boots.

00:02:55.333 --> 00:02:58.583
In honor of Ser SpongeRobert SquareTunic.

00:02:58.583 --> 00:03:00.666
Uh, so creative. You’re such an artist.

00:03:00.666 --> 00:03:03.125
Heyy…House Grumpy Boys…

00:03:03.125 --> 00:03:04.708
So you’re in Brooklyn now, eh?

00:03:04.708 --> 00:03:05.708
Indeed we are.

00:03:05.708 --> 00:03:07.541
Uh, I love it. Such a good fit.

00:03:07.541 --> 00:03:09.416
Great young core for you to demoralize.

00:03:09.416 --> 00:03:13.291
Oh! Alex Caruso’s here! Excuse me, gentlemen.

00:03:14.125 --> 00:03:15.541
Oh hey, Carmelo.

00:03:15.541 --> 00:03:18.458
How uh...what’s new with you?

00:03:18.458 --> 00:03:21.250
Oh you know…got a lot of irons in the fire.

00:03:21.250 --> 00:03:23.541
Oh yes? Are houses showing interest?

00:03:23.541 --> 00:03:25.708
No, I mean I’m actually a blacksmith now.

00:03:25.708 --> 00:03:30.041
Oh! Well, you know, I for one think you've been treated so unfairly

00:03:30.041 --> 00:03:33.291
by all those blog boy, media folk, analytics people.

00:03:33.291 --> 00:03:36.333
A knight of your caliber...you, ser, should be on a House...

00:03:36.333 --> 00:03:37.416
It's ridiculous!

00:03:37.416 --> 00:03:40.291
Thank you. Uh, well, you know, if you need anyone I’m avail–

00:03:40.291 --> 00:03:42.875
Well, I mean yeah, but the problem with the House Nets is that,

00:03:42.875 --> 00:03:44.416
with the cap and all it's–

00:03:44.416 --> 00:03:45.125
Yeah.

00:03:45.125 --> 00:03:46.708
But, uh, have you talked to Dame?

00:03:46.708 --> 00:03:48.541
Uh, I think House Blazers might be despera–

00:03:48.541 --> 00:03:50.666
...might be interested in a knight of your caliber?

00:03:51.375 --> 00:03:56.291
Ah, Ser Jayson, and Ser Jaylen, how are things?

00:03:56.291 --> 00:04:00.333
Well, you know, it’s never easy when you lose your best knight.

00:04:00.333 --> 00:04:03.833
No...it’s tough to see Al Horford on House Sixers.

00:04:03.833 --> 00:04:05.791
Hey Celtics guys...um...

00:04:05.791 --> 00:04:09.375
so I was wondering if it's possible for me to borrow this, 

00:04:09.375 --> 00:04:11.541
uh, soul box, you see, for I have

00:04:11.541 --> 00:04:14.041
a new teammate, and he is a bit, uh...

00:04:14.041 --> 00:04:18.458
Um, sorry, James, Gordon Hayward smashed it. It’s a long story...

00:04:18.458 --> 00:04:22.375
Oh, wow, OK. What even happens when you smash a soul box?

00:04:22.375 --> 00:04:25.625
Hey LeBron, just wanna say thank you so much for having us.

00:04:25.625 --> 00:04:27.458
Paul and I had a blast.

00:04:27.458 --> 00:04:28.875
Oh, are you guys leaving? Noo...

00:04:28.875 --> 00:04:31.125
We’re just about to start a big 1K tournament.

00:04:31.125 --> 00:04:34.833
Oh, I’d love to, but I actually played a game yesterday,

00:04:34.833 --> 00:04:39.125
and you know...I’m trying to manage me load, but uh–

00:04:39.125 --> 00:04:41.791
Understood. Well, so glad you guys could come

00:04:41.791 --> 00:04:45.541
and so excited for this little, “crosstown rivalry.”

00:04:45.541 --> 00:04:52.250
Remember guys, the only beef here, is in the pies! All right?

00:04:52.250 --> 00:04:55.000
Anyway, yeah, I thought the original Sea Jam was,

00:04:55.000 --> 00:04:57.291
frankly, a little overrated, OK?

00:04:58.791 --> 00:04:59.791
You’re soft.

00:04:59.791 --> 00:05:00.708
Ah!

00:05:03.083 --> 00:05:05.041
Your generation is soft.

00:05:05.041 --> 00:05:07.708
With your ‘load management,’ and your 'analytics,'

00:05:07.708 --> 00:05:10.041
and your 'AAU Super Houses',

00:05:10.041 --> 00:05:13.208
the gods of this game will not stand for this.

00:05:13.208 --> 00:05:15.125
A reckoning is coming.

00:05:17.583 --> 00:05:18.500
I thought Lola’s character

00:05:18.500 --> 00:05:20.500
was like, weirdly oversexualized.

00:05:20.500 --> 00:05:23.291
I was watching with Bronny Jr. and it was getting awkward–

00:05:23.291 --> 00:05:25.041
Whoa, what’s going on with Dion over there?

00:05:25.625 --> 00:05:26.625
Is he OK?

00:05:26.625 --> 00:05:29.166
Oh dear, I think he might have eaten my special pie.

00:05:29.166 --> 00:05:30.541
Uh, damnit JR!

00:05:33.750 --> 00:05:35.541
I just don’t understand.

00:05:35.541 --> 00:05:37.250
Why would Kawhi leave this place?

00:05:37.250 --> 00:05:38.250
It’s good, Fred.

00:05:38.250 --> 00:05:39.791
What do you mean it’s good?

00:05:39.791 --> 00:05:42.250
Kawhi showed us the way...showed us what it takes.

00:05:42.250 --> 00:05:46.416
And now it’s our North. Me. You. OG. The rest.

00:05:46.416 --> 00:05:49.125
We show the Realm we’re more than just The Claw.

00:05:49.125 --> 00:05:50.208
Wait, what the?

00:05:56.208 --> 00:05:58.625
Kawhi? Is that you?

00:06:01.166 --> 00:06:04.125
Uh...hello?

00:06:04.125 --> 00:06:05.666
I think it’s a fanling.

00:06:05.666 --> 00:06:07.291
Do you want us to sign your ball?

00:06:28.291 --> 00:06:31.958
Agh...no, no, no!

